        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Pirate Den</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pirate Den</i>, pirates are the true heroes. Your name must echo louder than the crashing waves. Recruit brave souls, send them on daring missions, and win the hearts of your fans. Your goal: build your legend and become the King of Pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/0006d74a81d3b4c4b2763bb721d830ca.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/0006d74a81d3b4c4b2763bb721d830ca.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/0006d74a81d3b4c4b2763bb721d830ca.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Crew to Feed, a Loyalty to Earn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew needs care. Feed them, pay them, and they'll keep sailing under your flag. Neglect them, and you'll soon find yourself alone, with only the sea for company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/406bd57333743606636b8682711cd436.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/406bd57333743606636b8682711cd436.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/406bd57333743606636b8682711cd436.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Journey is Different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no set path. Every voyage offers new choices, fresh opportunities, and unexpected twists. In <i>Pirate Den</i>, every run tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sneak Your Way to the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why choose between working and being a pirate captain? With a discreet interface, <i>Pirate Den</i> lets you recruit, sail, and plunder — all while looking perfectly busy on your screen. No one will suspect you're aiming for the crown.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Pirate Den</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pirate Den</i>, pirates are the true heroes. Your name must echo louder than the crashing waves. Recruit brave souls, send them on daring missions, and win the hearts of your fans. Your goal: build your legend and become the King of Pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/0006d74a81d3b4c4b2763bb721d830ca.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/0006d74a81d3b4c4b2763bb721d830ca.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/0006d74a81d3b4c4b2763bb721d830ca.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Crew to Feed, a Loyalty to Earn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew needs care. Feed them, pay them, and they'll keep sailing under your flag. Neglect them, and you'll soon find yourself alone, with only the sea for company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/406bd57333743606636b8682711cd436.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/406bd57333743606636b8682711cd436.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/406bd57333743606636b8682711cd436.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Journey is Different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no set path. Every voyage offers new choices, fresh opportunities, and unexpected twists. In <i>Pirate Den</i>, every run tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sneak Your Way to the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why choose between working and being a pirate captain? With a discreet interface, <i>Pirate Den</i> lets you recruit, sail, and plunder — all while looking perfectly busy on your screen. No one will suspect you're aiming for the crown.</p>",
